{"version":1,"content":"<p>官方新華社授權發布五中全會會議公報。</p><p>反腐風暴之下，出席這次全會的有，中央委員162人，候補中央委員117人。</p><p>二十屆中央委員原有205人，候補委員原有171人，總共376人，也就是說，出席率僅74.2%，大約四分之一中委出事。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:01:42.312732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:10.598697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:58:13.490827+00:00","content_hash":"98946e61452d4e89b0d3e9eedf82ee7589f5d37084d92296cb876b3c4fd70d1c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}